{"id":"especial","lemma":"especial","pos":"adj","rank":422,"glosses":["special (distinguished by a unique quality)","special (of particular interest or value)"],"ipa":"/espeˈθjal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"especiales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-especial.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué es tan especial?","en":"What's so special?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449183"},{"text":"Nosotros comemos langostas sólo en ocasiones especiales.","en":"We have lobsters only on special occasions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/517987"},{"text":"Usted no es especial.","en":"You're not special.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448823"},{"text":"Tom tiene habilidades especiales.","en":"Tom has special abilities."},{"text":"El sábado fue especial.","en":"Saturday was special.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455314"}]}